              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Apply Bayes’ theorem and split the denominator into the complementary cases ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "A",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " and ",
